# <type>: <what this commit does, in the present tense> (#<issue>)
#
# Types: feat (new feature), fix (bug fix), docs (documentation),
#        test (tests), refactor (same behaviour, better code),
#        style (formatting only), chore (housekeeping)
#
# Keep the first line to about 50 characters. No full stop at the end.
# Leave one blank line, then explain WHY if it is not obvious.
#
# If you worked with someone, credit them on the last line:
# Co-authored-by: Name <their-github-email>
